Package: mirtverse
Title: A Friendly Workflow and Reporting Layer for 'mirt'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Okan", "Bulut", email = "bulut@ualberta.ca", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Extends the 'mirt' package for item response theory with tidy
    outputs, 'ggplot2' graphics (trace lines, information, Wright maps, fit
    and local dependence plots), an automatic model selection assistant,
    plain-language interpretation of results, item health cards, one-call
    HTML reports, a point-and-click 'shiny' workbench that exports
    reproducible code, and a joint hierarchical model for responses and
    response times (van der Linden, 2007) with rapid-guessing flags, and a
    translator that turns 'ltm', 'eRm', 'TAM' and 'irtQ' code into 'mirt' code.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
